2026-08-16T12:25:36Z    [DE:Diluted EPS (GAAP)] GATE critic: You anchored FY2026Q3 to FY2024Q3 ($6.29) and applied a two‑year compound rate, but the correct like‑for‑like prior period for FY2026Q3 is FY2025Q3 (one year prior). Deere would have reported FY2025Q3 diluted EPS by Aug 2025, so using FY2024Q3 as the “most recent comparable” is a one‑year‑off prior‑year carryforward error that can be checked against the FY2025Q3 report.
2026-08-16T12:26:10Z    [HD:Comparable sales, total company] GATE critic: You anchored a quarterly metric (FY2026 Q2 comparable sales) to a full‑year guidance figure (“FY2026: Comparable sales growth of approximately flat to 2.0%”). That is a basis mismatch (annual vs quarterly). It also yields a Q2 point estimate of 2.20211%, which is above the stated 2.0% full‑year high end while Q1 was only +0.6%, flagging the inconsistency from using an annual guide to set a single quarter.
